  "note": "Round 23, rehearsed on the Blueback table, lane by the desk: eight pairs on the kit with per-round originals and lenient config reads (b6c8349). Three are refiles whose first runs the kit itself spoiled: llmfan46's and DuoNeural's 26B-A4B copies (round 14, originals swept from under them) and huihui-ai's Mistral Small 3.2 copy (round 13, the original's generation_config.json is not valid JSON). edwixx's diffusiongemma copy is the first of that family; aoiandroid and Bughacker are 12B copies on the most measured revision; DavidAU and dopaemon are E4B copies whose exports keep the original's tensor set. Held: eshucode E4B (shared-KV export), ccharnkij E4B (room), OpenYourMind 12B and unsloth Magistral (the pinner finds no original revision older than the copy), four Gemma 3 and MedGemma pairs (originals gated to the hub account), Voxtral text conversion (tensor names differ wholesale)."
